A tabbed verse line keeps the lead its frames leave

```
- a
  ::: |
  	x
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <div class="line-block">
      <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;x</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  ::: |
      x
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <div class="line-block">
      <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;x</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
:: t
: d
  ::: |
  	x
  :::
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>d</p>
    <div class="line-block">
      <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;x</p>
    </div>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
> - a
>   ::: |
>   	x
>   :::
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a
      <div class="line-block">
        <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;x</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```
